<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Trimark raises B.Philp stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Trimark raises B.Philp stake.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian investment group Trimark Financial Corp has raised its stake in Australian food group Burns, Philp &amp; Co Ltd to 13.5 percent from 11.84 percent, Trimark told the Australian Stock Exchange in a substantial shareholder notice.</p>
<p>Trimark now holds 70.45 million shares, compared with 61.81 million previously.</p>
<p>The stake is worth A$122.58 million at Friday's closing price of A$1.74, which is Burns Philp's lowest share price in 10 years.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
